nce (as thrown); especially the iron point","kjv_def":"buckler, javelin, lancet, spear.","n":15,"o":"NUM25:7 JDG5:8 1KI18:28 1CH12:8 1CH12:24 2CH11:12 2CH14:8 2CH25:5 2CH26:14 NEH4:13 NEH4:16 NEH4:21 JER46:4 EZK39:9 JOL3:10"},"H7421":{"lemma":"רַמִּי","xlit":"rammîy","pron":"ram-mee'","derivation":"for H761 (אֲרַמִּי);","strongs_def":"a Ramite, i.e. Aramaean","kjv_def":"Syrian.","n":1,"o":"2CH22:5"},"H7422":{"lemma":"רַמְיָה","xlit":"Ramyâh","pron":"ram-yaw'","derivation":"from H7311 (רוּם) and H3050 (יָהּ); Jah has raised;","strongs_def":"Ramjah, an Israelite","kjv_def":"Ramiah.","n":1,"o":"EZR10:25"},"H7423":{"lemma":"רְמִיָּה","xlit":"rᵉmîyâh","pron":"rem-ee-yaw'","derivation":"from H7411 (רָמָה);","strongs_def":"remissness, treachery","kjv_def":"deceit(-ful, -fully), false, guile, idle, slack, slothful.","n":15,"o":"JOB13:7 JOB27:4 PSA32:2 PSA52:2 PSA78:57 PSA101:7 PSA120:2 PSA120:3 PRO10:4 PRO12:24 PRO12:27 PRO19:15 JER48:10 HOS7:16 MIC6:12"},"H7424":{"lemma":"רַמָּךְ","xlit":"rammâk","pron":"ram-mawk'","derivation":"of foreign origin;","strongs_def":"a brood mare","kjv_def":"dromedary.","n":1,"o":"EST8:10"},"H7425":{"lemma":"רְמַלְיָהוּ","xlit":"Rᵉmalyâhûw","pron":"rem-al-yaw'-hoo","derivation":"from an unused root and H3050 (יָהּ) (perhaps meaning to deck); Jah has bedecked;","strongs_def":"Remaljah, an Israelite","kjv_def":"Remaliah.","n":13,"o":"2KI15:25 2KI15:27 2KI15:30 2KI15:32 2KI15:37 2KI16:1 2KI16:5 2CH28:6 ISA7:1 ISA7:4 ISA7:5 ISA7:9 ISA8:6"},"H7426":{"lemma":"רָמַם","xlit":"râmam","pron":"raw-mam'","derivation":"a primitive root;","strongs_def":"to rise (literally or figuratively)","kjv_def":"exalt, get (oneself) up, lift up (self), mount up.","n":7,"o":"NUM16:45 JOB24:24 PSA118:16 ISA33:10 EZK10:15 EZK10:17 EZK10:19"},"H7427":{"lemma":"רֹמֵמֻת","xlit":"rômêmuth","pron":"ro-may-mooth'","derivation":"from the active participle of H7426 (רָמַם);","strongs_def":"exaltation","kjv_def":"lifting up of self.","n":1,"o":"ISA33:3"},"H7428":{"lemma":"רִמֹּן פ